#### STD-UI-001: Utility Classes Only

**MUST** apply styles exclusively via Tailwind CSS utility classes on HTML elements and React components. Do not write component-scoped CSS files (`.module.css`) for new work unless a specific styling requirement cannot be achieved with Tailwind utilities.

```tsx
// ✅ COMPLIANT — utility classes only
<div className="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-md border bg-card p-4 text-card-foreground shadow-sm">
  {children}
</div>

// ❌ NON-COMPLIANT — scoped CSS file for styling that Tailwind can handle
// card.module.css
// .card { display: flex; align-items: center; ... }
```

