#### STD-UI-011: No Shared CSS Files for Component Styles

**MUST NOT** create shared CSS files that style specific components by class name or element selector. Shared CSS creates implicit coupling and makes component portability difficult.

```css
/* ❌ NON-COMPLIANT — shared CSS file targeting a component's internal elements */
/* components/claim-status.css */
.claim-status-badge { ... }
.claim-status-badge.success { ... }
```

