[standards/application/styling/STD-APP-UI-001-frontend-styling-standards.md#std-ui-021-tailwind-spacing-scale]

#### STD-UI-021: Tailwind Spacing Scale

**MUST** use the Tailwind 4-point spacing scale (`p-1` = 4px, `p-2` = 8px, `p-4` = 16px, `p-6` = 24px, `p-8` = 32px) for all padding and margin. Do not use arbitrary spacing values for standard layout spacing.

```tsx
// ✅ COMPLIANT — 4-point scale values
<div className="p-4">         {/* 16px */}
<div className="gap-6">       {/* 24px */}
<div className="mt-8">        {/* 32px */}

// ❌ NON-COMPLIANT — arbitrary spacing not on the 4-point scale
<div className="p-[13px]">
```

**Exception**: Hairline separators, icon-specific sizes, and animation offsets may use arbitrary values where the scale has no equivalent.

